OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and mostly cloudy morning
OL,6,Fbut some bright or sunny intervals
OL,7,Fbreaking through. Remaining dry in the
OL,8,Fafternoon but cloud thickening.
OL,9,FSoutheasterly winds strengthening with
OL,10,Fcoastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry and cloudy this
OL,13,Fevening, with rain reaching the
OL,14,FWestern Isles near midnight. Heavy
OL,15,Frain then spreads east overnight.
OL,16,FStrong southeasterly winds bring
OL,17,Fcoastal gales or severe gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
