OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain at
OL,6,Ffirst. Rain soon clearing eastwards to
OL,7,Fleave a largely dry day with long
OL,8,Fsunny spells developing. Breezy with
OL,9,Fstrong winds over the Western Isles.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells with a few showers on Thursday,
OL,13,Fcloudier with rain spreading east in
OL,14,Fthe evening. Mostly cloudy Friday with
OL,15,Frain or showers. Sunny spells and
OL,16,Fshowers Saturday. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
